WEBVTT

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.375
Artificial Intelligence is changing
everything:

00:00:05.375 --> 00:00:09.125
healthcare, transportation,
manufacturing, and finance.

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:13.916
But AI comes with an enormous demand:
computational power.

00:00:13.916 --> 00:00:16.541
Computing needs are doubling
every six months

00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:20.250
and traditional data center
designs just can’t keep up.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.958
This exponential growth demands

00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:26.250
more than upgrades—it calls
for transformation.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.250
The old way?

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:31.416
It was proprietary,
driving fragmentation, siloed,

00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:34.291
and thus costly;
and may seem fast at first,

00:00:34.291 --> 00:00:38.708
but in the long run, it slows
down your ability to keep up with change.

00:00:40.083 --> 00:00:41.666
The Open Compute way?

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:46.666
It’s open, modular, and designed
for technological scale and evolution.

00:00:46.666 --> 00:00:50.666
The Open Compute Project’s
Open Systems for AI initiative

00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:53.666
brings together together 
hyperscalers, vendors,

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:56.916
and innovators to build AI infrastructure

00:00:56.916 --> 00:01:00.041
that’s robust, efficient,
and interoperable.

00:01:00.041 --> 00:01:04.208
We’re talking megawatt-scale
AI data centers with the most efficient

00:01:04.208 --> 00:01:07.708
power and cooling, and open standards
that anyone can build on.

00:01:08.916 --> 00:01:11.000
It’s not just some specs.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.041
It's a global community,
working together to future-proof AI

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:17.666
and make its benefits
accessible everywhere.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:22.500
Our foundations are built
upon OCP’s core tenets.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:26.916
Every design and every solution is created
for real-world impact.

00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:29.916
This is your first step into the 
future of AI infrastructure.

00:01:30.041 --> 00:01:33.958
Open. Scalable.
And ready for what’s next.